<div id="layer-plugins" class="app-layer hidden flex-col p-4 h-[100dvh] w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#060913]">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between shrink-0 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><button onclick="volverAlLauncher()" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/5 text-gray-300"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i></button><div><h2 class="text-[17px] font-black uppercase text-white">Plugins</h2><p class="text-[8px] text-violet-400 font-mono tracking-widest">GOLDHEN PLUGIN LOADER</p></div></div><button onclick="pluginsRecargar()" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-violet-500/10 border border-violet-500/20 text-violet-400"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-right"></i></button></div>
    <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto hide-scrollbar flex flex-col gap-4 pb-6">
        <div class="bg-[#0a0f1a] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-4"><p class="text-[9px] text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-3">La asignación se actualiza en <b class="text-violet-400">plugins.ini</b>. Se conserva una copia local antes de cada cambio. Reinicia GoldHEN o la consola para aplicarlo.</p><button onclick="pluginsAbrirDiagnostico()" class="mb-3 flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-amber-400/15 bg-amber-400/5 py-2.5 text-[9px] font-bold text-amber-200 hover:bg-amber-400/10"><i class="fa-solid fa-stethoscope"></i> Diagnosticar plugins.ini</button><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2"><button onclick="pluginsExportarIni()" class="py-2 rounded-xl bg-white/5 text-[9px] text-gray-300"><i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> Exportar</button><label class="py-2 rounded-xl bg-violet-500/15 text-[9px] text-violet-300 text-center cursor-pointer"><i class="fa-solid fa-upload"></i> Importar<input id="plugins-import" type="file" accept=".ini,text/plain" class="hidden" onchange="pluginsImportarIni(event)"></label><button onclick="pluginsRecargar()" class="py-2 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 text-[9px] text-cyan-300"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-right"></i> Actualizar</button></div></div>
        <div class="bg-[#0a0f1a] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-4 flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="text-[9px] uppercase font-black tracking-widest text-gray-400">Aplicación/juego seleccionado</span><input id="plugins-section" type="hidden" value="default"><button type="button" onclick="pluginsAbrirSelector()" class="w-full min-h-16 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/25 p-2 flex items-center gap-3 text-left"><div id="plugins-target-cover" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-violet-500/15 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-violet-300"><i class="fa-solid fa-globe"></i></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><b id="plugins-target-name" class="block text-[11px] text-white truncate">Entorno general</b><span id="plugins-target-id" class="block text-[8px] text-gray-500 font-mono">[default] · Plugins activos en todo el sistema</span></div><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-violet-400 text-xs"></i></button></div>
        <div class="bg-[#0a0f1a] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-4"><div class="flex justify-between mb-3"><span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-black tracking-widest text-white">Instalados en PS4</span><span id="plugins-remote-count" class="text-[9px] text-gray-500">0</span></div><p class="text-[8px] text-gray-500 mb-2">Activa o desactiva cada plugin para la aplicación/juego seleccionado.</p><div id="plugins-remote-list" class="flex flex-col gap-2"></div></div>
        <div class="bg-[#0a0f1a] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-4"><div class="flex justify-between mb-3"><span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-black tracking-widest text-white">En teléfono / PS4 Manager Tool</span><label class="text-[9px] text-violet-400 cursor-pointer"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Añadir PRX<input id="plugins-upload" type="file" accept=".prx" class="hidden" onchange="pluginsSubir(event)"></label></div><div id="plugins-local-list" class="flex flex-col gap-2"></div></div>
    </div>
</div>
<div id="plugins-diagnostic-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[10060] hidden items-end justify-center bg-black/75 p-3 backdrop-blur-sm sm:items-center sm:p-5" onclick="if(event.target===this)pluginsCerrarDiagnostico()"><section class="flex max-h-[92dvh] w-full max-w-2xl flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-amber-400/20 bg-[#080d17] shadow-2xl"><header class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-between border-b border-white/5 p-4"><div><h3 class="text-sm font-black text-white"><i class="fa-solid fa-stethoscope mr-2 text-amber-300"></i>Diagnóstico de plugins.ini</h3><p class="mt-1 text-[9px] text-gray-400">Analiza el archivo y compara sus rutas con los .prx instalados.</p></div><button type="button" onclick="pluginsCerrarDiagnostico()" class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-white/5 text-gray-300" aria-label="Cerrar diagnóstico"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button></header><div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-4"><p id="plugins-diagnostic-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.03] p-3 text-center text-[9px] text-gray-300">Leyendo plugins.ini…</p><div id="plugins-diagnostic-summary" class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2"></div><div id="plugins-diagnostic-issues" class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2"></div><div id="plugins-diagnostic-preview" class="mt-3 hidden overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-emerald-400/15"><div class="border-b border-white/5 px-3 py-2 text-[9px] font-bold text-emerald-200">Vista previa propuesta</div><pre id="plugins-diagnostic-preview-text" class="max-h-64 overflow-auto whitespace-pre-wrap break-all p-3 font-mono text-[9px] leading-relaxed text-gray-200"></pre></div><p class="mt-3 text-[8px] leading-relaxed text-gray-500">La reparación conserva las asignaciones válidas y fusiona secciones repetidas, elimina rutas duplicadas y secciones vacías, limpia líneas no válidas y ordena una ruta por línea. Las referencias sin archivo .prx se advierten, pero no se eliminan automáticamente.</p></div><footer class="flex shrink-0 flex-wrap justify-end gap-2 border-t border-white/5 p-3"><button id="plugins-diagnostic-preview-btn" type="button" onclick="pluginsVerVistaPrevia()" disabled class="rounded-xl bg-white/5 px-3 py-2 text-[9px] font-bold text-gray-200 disabled:opacity-40">Ver vista previa</button><button id="plugins-diagnostic-repair-btn" type="button" onclick="pluginsAplicarReparacion()" disabled class="rounded-xl bg-amber-400/15 px-3 py-2 text-[9px] font-bold text-amber-100 disabled:opacity-40">Reparar con respaldo</button><button type="button" onclick="pluginsCerrarDiagnostico()" class="rounded-xl bg-white/5 px-3 py-2 text-[9px] text-gray-300">Cerrar</button></footer></section></div><div id="plugins-selector-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[10050] hidden items-end sm:items-center justify-center bg-black/70 p-4" onclick="if(event.target===this)pluginsCerrarSelector()"><div class="w-full max-w-lg max-h-[84dvh] rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0f1a] p-4 shadow-2xl flex flex-col"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3"><div><b class="text-sm text-white">Seleccionar aplicación/juego</b><p class="text-[9px] text-gray-500">El destino determina la sección de plugins.ini.</p></div><button onclick="pluginsCerrarSelector()" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-white/5 text-gray-300"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button></div><input id="plugins-game-search" oninput="pluginsRenderizarSelector()" placeholder="Buscar por nombre o CUSA..." class="mb-3 rounded-xl bg-black/30 border border-white/10 px-3 py-3 text-[10px] text-white outline-none"><div id="plugins-game-list" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 overflow-y-auto hide-scrollbar"></div></div></div>

